    given-names: Sandro
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/[anonymized]/relational-carrier-manifest"
abstract: >-
  P0 reader's-guide manifest for the relational-carrier-theory corpus
  (papers P1-P6 plus the bridge note). One-sentence thesis, three
  load-bearing claims, two-branch decomposition (vacuum / matter-flip),
  closure-tier vocabulary (EXACT / PRECISE / FACTOR2; load-bearing /
  downstream / supporting / external / open), top-tier closures table
  (~35 rows), six falsification handles decidable within 2 years
  (DESI DR3, CMB-S4, JWST), and reading routing. This guide makes no
  new numerical claims; every numerical value, closure form, and
  falsification handle is sourced to the technical paper that owns it.
keywords:
  - relational-carrier-theory
  - reader-guide
